{#
  partials/profile-disclaimer.njk — the sourcing and confidence banner

  Required on every profile page. Its position is not fixed: layouts/profile.njk
  puts it at the foot of a confirmed profile and at the head of anything less,
  because a caveat a reader needs before believing the page has to come first,
  while on a confirmed profile it is the closing note on a record the page has
  already made its case for.

  Usage: set `disclaimerProfile` before including.
    {% set disclaimerProfile = profile %}
    {% include "partials/profile-disclaimer.njk" %}
#}
<div class="disclaimer-banner">
  <strong>Sourcing &amp; confidence disclaimer</strong>
  <p>Every claim on this profile comes from the sources cited on it. Nothing has been added or inferred.</p>
  {% for paragraph in disclaimerProfile.disclaimer | paragraphs %}<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>{% endfor %}
  <p>
    Attribution confidence:
    {% set confidenceLevel = disclaimerProfile.confidence_level %}{% include "partials/confidence-badge.njk" %}
  </p>
  <p>If this entry concerns you, see <a href="/guidance/#listed">If you are listed on this site</a>.</p>
</div>
